WEBVTT

00:00:00.207 --> 00:00:00.974
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.533
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you manage to agree anything with your ex-wife?

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:08.543
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, we went back and forth for hours, but we just couldn’t agree.

00:00:10.564 --> 00:00:11.264
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:14.032
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you think you’d finish the marathon?

00:00:14.232 --> 00:00:18.491
<v><b>B:</b></v> I wasn’t sure, but once I got to the park, I knew I was home and dry.

00:00:20.485 --> 00:00:21.318
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:24.655
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you ever get back that money from your brother?

00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:27.378
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I didn’t. Oh, well, you live and learn.

00:00:29.365 --> 00:00:30.172
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:31.068 --> 00:00:34.200
<v><b>A:</b></v> But, Mum, I don’t want to work in a café this summer.

00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:38.249
<v><b>B:</b></v> You can’t pick and choose – just take any job you can get.

00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:41.035
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:41.928 --> 00:00:44.418
<v><b>A:</b></v> Your job sounds quite complicated. Is it?

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:47.340
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, it takes a while to learn all the ins and outs.

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.180
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.833
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you sleep OK last night?

00:00:53.196 --> 00:00:57.420
<v><b>B:</b></v> Not really, it was too hot. I tossed and turned for hours.